        <mxCell id="finding" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#18333e;strokeColor=#4d7682;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;" value="&lt;b&gt;Finding: Report CJ-603 is a BRIDGE inspection (W06-S02). The approved policy requires it to go to Structures (W06-S03) but the delivery shows it went to Electrical(W06-S04). The records show a routing discrepancy but don&#39;t establish its cause.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unanswered question: What routing table entries or system configuration were active when report CJ-603 was processed and could they explain why it went to Electrical instead of Structures?&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
